<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 2.110 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 2.110 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 2.110 billion pesos in the secondary market on Friday through one single credit auction, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>2.110 bln  3 days</p>
<p>*Amount in pesos</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
